<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end-June 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				   3,307  vs   3,243</p>
<p>	 Of which third quarter	     1,183  vs   1,117</p>
<p>NOTE - Metaleurop released the results in the BALO financial announcements gazette.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
